Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,Basketball Star Player
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, the registration deadline was approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazey discovered that Jonie, who was helping out from the sidelines, had a talent for playing center,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and invited her to join the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After winning a one-on-one match against Sparky,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie realized she could protect her friends on the court,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and agreed to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The group finally succeeded in registering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Wolnie and Wilie,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m training hard every day now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:01:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I recently made another beautiful three-pointer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fans are all chasing after me for autographs!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.12,0:01:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No. 99!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn’t even made the reserve squad yet—it’s hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My teammates really like me; we’re always laughing and chatting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,As the team’s star player, I even got to stay in a VIP suite!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you become the star player?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.80,0:01:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I—I just didn’t want Wolnie and Wilie to be disappointed in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if Wolnie and Wilie find out you lied to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn’t they be even more disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t let them know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.64,0:02:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No. 99, do you have nothing better to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Chatting away, of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m punishing you by making you clean the entire training camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I the only one being punished? He was chatting too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.06,0:02:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you guys get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was working so hard and didn’t notice at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.70,0:02:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.86,0:02:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get out there for running drills.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.14,0:02:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.26,0:02:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, finish cleaning up quickly and go join the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma’am!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.90,0:02:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Move your leg a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The list of opponents for your first match is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll be facing Team Rats in our first match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve grown a lot since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, we’re definitely going to beat them on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Rats is a force to be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Champ has lightning-fast offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Trump has rock-solid defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The other players are seasoned veterans, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The stats show our chances of winning are slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have Coach; he’ll definitely help us…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you’re done talking, let’s go train.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you two here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought Daddy some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.10,0:03:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t it a nice surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie and I put a lot of effort into making this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.86,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie, you’re amazing! This…this really is a wonderful surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, didn’t you tell me you were the star player of the basketball team?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you mopping the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not mopping; I’m working on my arm strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As a basketball star player,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my own unique training methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we’re already here, aren’t you going to show us around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.26,0:04:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the team is going into seclusion for intensive training,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,outsiders aren’t allowed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Wilie go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can steal the ball now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie, it’s time to go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I want to watch Daddy play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d like to see the basketball star player in action, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Basketball star player?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Dad is amazing at basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just play along.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong? Is your eyelid twitching?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m begging you, please play along with this act.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I—I don’t want to let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fetch the balls for you; I’ll help clean up every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re all family; how could we not help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:06:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you insisted on helping us clean up and fetch the balls…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.14,0:06:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we have no reason to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just finished warming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let me show you the true style of a basketball star player.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, let them take the first serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy is so handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to steal your ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,—Slow down a bit.　—Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! That was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Got the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,—Wolffy is amazing!　—Daddy is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m making a feint.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a brilliant feint!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! That’s awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t block the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Explosive Dunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.18,0:07:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of our star player!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.62,0:07:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you help me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach only has us practicing the basics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to win games with just the basics?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.06,0:08:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can master this move,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe we’ll stand a chance against Team Rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, basketball star player!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:09:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Star player, you’re done showing off—time to clean up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, let me sink this last shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, the basketball star player, has just made another incredibly cool shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No. 99, aren’t you supposed to be cleaning up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re just as useless as those little goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.78,0:09:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t belong on a basketball court at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What right do you have to say that the goats and I don’t belong here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to take back what you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you’re getting feisty now? If you can manage to snatch the ball from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll pretend I never said those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t even touch the shadow of the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so focused on watching your Daddy playing that I forgot to give him the lunchbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t even get it like that? Aren’t you the basketball star player?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s outrageous! Let’s go help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.90,0:10:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, you—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweep the floor more often when you have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t keep saying you’re the basketball star player.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.26,0:10:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Daddy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, isn’t Daddy the star player of the basketball team?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Silly boy, if Dad says he’s the basketball star player,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,then he definitely is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.26,0:11:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But why did Daddy lose just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone experiences failure at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But as long as you don’t give up, you’ll definitely win next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe Daddy will win back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Because…He is the best basketball star player.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.70,0:11:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He will definitely become the best basketball star player.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie, son,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will definitely become the basketball star player you look up to.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
